1
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,982
<i>Nat, watch out!</i>

2
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:10,200
<i>It means the cycle will turn,
bringing back your karma.</i>

3
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,680
<i>You reap what you sow.</i>

4
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,320
<i>They're evil.</i>

5
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,564
<i>You need to know the whole truth.</i>

6
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,600
<i>But I saw it.</i>

7
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:25,680
<i>Saw what?</i>

8
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:29,371
<i>The three of you in the past.
You hurt people, and they want revenge.</i>

9
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,320
Yo!

10
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:41,840
You must die!

11
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,445
Yo...

12
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,680
- Yo!
- Nat!

13
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,488
What's wrong with you, Yo?

14
00:01:55,266 --> 00:01:57,093
Stop causing trouble.

15
00:01:57,093 --> 00:01:58,718
I don't care who you date.

16
00:01:58,718 --> 00:02:01,280
But you have to accept my story too.

17
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,400
And if you say you were possessed,

18
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:06,360
then you must believe
Whan and I were possessed too.

19
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:10,160
Nat, don't go. Listen to me.

20
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,120
I'm worried about you.

21
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,835
Nat!

22
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,080
I didn't possess them!

23
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,200
They're evil!

24
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:43,080
Do you hear me? They're evil!

25
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,440
I'll get back at them!

26
00:02:44,440 --> 00:02:45,640
I didn't possess them!

27
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,906
They're evil!

28
00:02:47,906 --> 00:02:50,360
- I didn't possess them!
- They're evil!

29
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,895
I'll get back at them!

30
00:02:51,895 --> 00:02:53,200
I didn't possess them!

31
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,560
I'll get back at them!

32
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,980
They're evil!

33
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:57,400
I'll get back at them!

34
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,680
I didn't possess them!

35
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,711
They're evil!

36
00:03:14,813 --> 00:03:16,000
Hey...

37
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,720
Yo!

38
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:19,400
Hey!

39
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:22,120
<i>You want me to find a new place</i>

40
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:25,040
<i>so it'll be easier for us to meet, right?</i>

41
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,673
<i>What do you think?</i>

42
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:30,958
<i>Okay. After breakfast, I'll ask Yo
if I can go look at a place.</i>

43
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:36,391
Hey, Yo.

44
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,273
You're dead!

45
00:04:56,360 --> 00:05:01,217
<i>The three of you in the past.
You hurt people, and they want revenge.</i>

46
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:07,876
Yo.

47
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,720
Yo.

48
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,600
Yo.

49
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,314
Yo.

50
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:03,179
I'm not Yo.

51
00:06:03,179 --> 00:06:06,080
Yo, focus! Don't let it possess you!

52
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:07,832
You can't control me.

53
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:21,558
You want to know the truth, don't you?

54
00:06:21,558 --> 00:06:24,455
I'll show you what really happened.

55
00:06:41,886 --> 00:06:44,080
Bring Sali to me.

56
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,460
Yes, sir.

57
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:08,220
Please stop, Master Lert.

58
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:12,367
Sali... Sali...

59
00:07:53,880 --> 00:07:55,320
I'll lead them the other way.

60
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,600
Meet me at the abandoned temple south of here.

61
00:07:57,600 --> 00:08:02,676
No! I told you. If we die, we die together.

62
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:06,664
Don't worry about me.
I can take care of myself.

63
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:11,160
Pan, get Sali out of here. Hurry!

64
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:14,245
Yohd, you have to be okay.

65
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,720
I'll be fine.

66
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,565
Go. Hurry.

67
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,600
They dared to run away.

68
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:40,160
Find them and bring them back!

69
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,563
Or Master Lert will kill you all.

70
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,640
You lot, that way! Go!

71
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:56,513
Yohd! Go!

72
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,673
Stop!

73
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,579
Yohd!

74
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:32,049
Yohd, you're dead!

75
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:43,193
Pan, let's go back to help Yohd.

76
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:46,286
Please...

77
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:53,986
Sali... Sali!

78
00:09:58,279 --> 00:10:02,594
Are you going to tell me
where Pan and Sali are?

79
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,626
Whip her harder!

80
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,782
Throw salt water on her.

81
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:34,036
Are you going to tell me now?

82
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,486
This is what you get

83
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,049
for keeping your mouth shut, Yohd.

84
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:26,285
Yohd!

85
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:33,200
Lady Bulan, please stop.

86
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:35,628
We won't try to run away again.

87
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:56,731
Take him to my room.
Pry out his fingernails until he wakes.

88
00:11:56,731 --> 00:11:58,000
Yes, sir.

89
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,994
Pan!

90
00:12:10,453 --> 00:12:15,297
Lady Bulan, please have mercy.
Please let us go.

91
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:25,685
Yohd...

92
00:12:26,315 --> 00:12:28,200
Yohd...

93
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,161
Yohd...

94
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:36,800
Take care of my parents for me.

95
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,573
Yohd!

96
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:49,260
You want to die like Yohd?

97
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:58,702
No, you die!

98
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:50,920
You're a slave.

99
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:54,224
You think you can escape
your master that easily?

100
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:05,760
Go on. Go save your wife.

101
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:07,760
I'm letting you go.

102
00:15:00,215 --> 00:15:01,633
I let you go.

103
00:15:01,633 --> 00:15:03,961
I never said you'd survive.

104
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:16,283
Whip her!

105
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,992
I love seeing people in love.

106
00:15:58,600 --> 00:16:04,289
Love makes fools do foolish things.

107
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:10,015
Do you want your husband to live?

108
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:19,308
Then trade your hand for his life.

109
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:30,150
No... Please, no.

110
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:41,249
It's not an order.

111
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:44,182
It's a choice.

112
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:52,773
No... Sali.

113
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:06,272
No, Sali!

114
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:29,179
Sali!

115
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,944
Sali!

116
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,744
Sali...

117
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:23,833
Pan... Pan!

118
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:35,571
Look what your love has brought you.

119
00:18:35,571 --> 00:18:37,826
In the end, you hurt each other.

120
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:48,647
I'll haunt you in every lifetime.

121
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,485
You talk too much, don't you?

122
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:02,318
I'll haunt you in every lifetime.

123
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,531
Pam.

124
00:20:09,720 --> 00:20:11,169
Pam.

125
00:20:20,120 --> 00:20:24,262
Pam, this isn't funny. Come up now.

126
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:32,344
Nat... she swore she'd haunt me
in every lifetime.

127
00:20:32,935 --> 00:20:35,400
You just fell asleep
and slipped under the water.

128
00:20:35,400 --> 00:20:37,675
There's no one here.

129
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:46,860
Here.

130
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,527
It's in the mirror.

131
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:07,338
All I see is you and your paranoia.

132
00:21:10,159 --> 00:21:12,011
There's nothing there.

133
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:42,080
Bind their souls. Never let them be reborn.

134
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:44,718
Throw their bodies to the vultures.

135
00:21:49,280 --> 00:21:51,299
I'll get back at all of you.

136
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:59,274
I'll get back at you.

137
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:02,704
I'll get back at all of you.

138
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:07,179
I'll get back at all of you.

139
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:17,409
Yo.

140
00:22:19,363 --> 00:22:22,140
- Yo.
- I'll get back at you.

141
00:22:22,140 --> 00:22:23,920
I'll get back at all of you.

142
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:30,360
I'll get back at all of you.

143
00:22:30,360 --> 00:22:33,093
I'll get back at all of you.

144
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,514
I'll get back at you.

145
00:22:43,080 --> 00:22:44,680
Yo.

146
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:46,213
Yo.

147
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:07,575
I saw what they did to them.

148
00:23:10,640 --> 00:23:12,763
I feel so sorry for them.

149
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:15,960
You have to stay strong, Yo.

150
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,960
Don't let them take over.

151
00:23:52,760 --> 00:23:54,575
From what you've told me,

152
00:23:54,575 --> 00:23:59,379
they're using you to get revenge because
your will isn't strong.

153
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:02,318
I saw the three of them.

154
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:06,005
They were tortured to death.

155
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:10,185
How could anyone be so cruel?

156
00:24:10,185 --> 00:24:15,068
Back then, masters had
the power of life and death.

157
00:24:15,068 --> 00:24:17,400
But what they resent even more is...

158
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:22,500
that their trapped souls can never be reborn.

159
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,287
Is there any way to fix this?

160
00:24:27,920 --> 00:24:29,201
Yes.

161
00:24:30,600 --> 00:24:32,314
The three from the past,

162
00:24:33,080 --> 00:24:38,041
Lert, Bulan, and Sroi must die.

163
00:24:44,040 --> 00:24:50,000
That means your husband, Pam, and Whan...

164
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:51,578
They must die.

165
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:56,689
Is there any way to save them?

166
00:25:13,280 --> 00:25:14,841
What's wrong?

167
00:25:17,840 --> 00:25:19,297
Yo's coming over.

168
00:25:29,760 --> 00:25:31,588
Nat, you have to become a monk.

169
00:25:32,360 --> 00:25:35,080
Over some crazy dream of yours?

170
00:25:35,080 --> 00:25:36,800
I saw it with my own eyes, Nat.

171
00:25:36,800 --> 00:25:41,428
With your own eyes? Come on, Yo. How?

172
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:49,624
I know you don't believe me,
but I'm serious, Nat.

173
00:25:51,000 --> 00:25:52,523
Please become a monk, Nat.

174
00:25:53,280 --> 00:25:58,120
So you can make merit
for those you've wronged in the past.

175
00:25:58,120 --> 00:25:59,520
Please, Nat.

176
00:25:59,520 --> 00:26:01,680
I'm serious too, Yo.

177
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:03,600
I'm not becoming a monk.

178
00:26:03,600 --> 00:26:04,899
Nat...

179
00:26:05,720 --> 00:26:07,462
Let's not fight right now.

180
00:26:08,946 --> 00:26:10,824
I know you mean well.

181
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:15,076
Thank you. I'll talk to Nat about it.

182
00:26:33,040 --> 00:26:34,667
What do you mean?

183
00:26:34,667 --> 00:26:37,249
I think Yo is genuinely worried about us.

184
00:26:38,579 --> 00:26:41,321
And maybe she really did see something.

185
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:59,853
I think I saw something too.

186
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,600
Last night, when I was leaving,

187
00:27:07,600 --> 00:27:11,198
I'm sure I walked into the elevator alone.

188
00:27:11,198 --> 00:27:12,680
But while I was in there,

189
00:27:12,680 --> 00:27:16,993
I felt like someone was watching me.

190
00:27:19,560 --> 00:27:23,813
When I got out, I turned around to look again.

191
00:27:23,813 --> 00:27:26,923
There were three people
standing in the elevator.

192
00:27:28,866 --> 00:27:31,035
They looked terrifying.

193
00:27:31,035 --> 00:27:33,995
Were you drunk? We did drink quite a lot.

194
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,660
You should listen to Yo, Nat.

195
00:27:44,360 --> 00:27:46,388
The day I sank into the bathtub,

196
00:27:47,480 --> 00:27:51,022
I really felt someone pulling me under.

197
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,120
Pam...

198
00:27:53,120 --> 00:27:58,600
I know we'd been drinking,
but I wasn't drunk or dreaming.

199
00:27:58,600 --> 00:28:01,360
And I wasn't obsessing
over what that fortune teller said.

200
00:28:01,360 --> 00:28:03,643
But I really saw a ghost.

201
00:28:05,600 --> 00:28:07,280
The ghost of someone we once hurt.

202
00:28:07,280 --> 00:28:09,000
We've never hurt anyone.

203
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,720
Not in this lifetime, Nat.

204
00:28:10,720 --> 00:28:13,558
I've never hurt anyone in any lifetime.

205
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:18,752
Then look at this.

206
00:28:30,880 --> 00:28:33,184
A ghost strangled me, Nat.

207
00:28:34,026 --> 00:28:35,537
I'm scared.

208
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:40,440
Don't be scared. Trust me.

209
00:28:40,440 --> 00:28:42,240
Ghosts aren't real.

210
00:28:55,320 --> 00:28:57,453
I want to talk to you about Yo.

211
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:02,702
I knew this was about Yo.

212
00:29:02,702 --> 00:29:06,720
Since we broke up,
you've never wanted to see me again.

213
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:09,053
We're over. Why would I?

214
00:29:11,520 --> 00:29:16,833
So why did you ask me here to talk about Yo?

215
00:29:16,833 --> 00:29:21,520
I saw the clip of you and Nat
talking about finding a new place.

216
00:29:21,520 --> 00:29:23,990
<i>You want me to find a new place</i>

217
00:29:23,990 --> 00:29:27,441
<i>so it'll be easier for us
to see each other, right?</i>

218
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:31,200
You two were already having an affair.

219
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:33,000
It wasn't because you were possessed.

220
00:29:33,880 --> 00:29:36,133
And now the ghosts are angry.

221
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:40,400
Do I have to believe that ghosts are real?

222
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:42,066
That's up to you.

223
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:46,020
But I really want you to change.

224
00:29:46,020 --> 00:29:47,920
Yo hasn't seen the clip yet.

225
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:49,576
You still have time to change.

226
00:29:49,576 --> 00:29:52,400
It's too late, Pete.

227
00:29:52,400 --> 00:29:56,200
Because now Nat, Pam, and I

228
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:58,720
are happy being together like this.

229
00:29:58,720 --> 00:30:00,440
Do whatever you want with that clip.

230
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:02,377
I don't care.

231
00:30:15,080 --> 00:30:17,840
<i>You want me to find a new place</i>

232
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:20,840
<i>so it'll be easier for us
to see each other, right?</i>

233
00:30:20,840 --> 00:30:22,920
<i>What do you think?</i>

234
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:25,240
<i>After breakfast, I'll ask...</i>

235
00:30:27,160 --> 00:30:29,645
The day I found you unconscious here,

236
00:30:30,660 --> 00:30:33,491
this clip suddenly popped up on your phone.

237
00:30:33,491 --> 00:30:36,840
I think they wanted you to see it.

238
00:30:36,840 --> 00:30:38,970
I really don't feel anything anymore.

239
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:46,140
Now I know for sure
those two were having an affair.

240
00:30:46,920 --> 00:30:50,239
It wasn't possession,
like they tried to tell me.

241
00:30:51,080 --> 00:30:53,230
I don't want you involved with them anymore.

242
00:31:02,120 --> 00:31:03,605
I'm worried about you.

243
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:08,801
The spirits are trying to take control of you.

244
00:31:09,520 --> 00:31:12,043
And your relationship is toxic.

245
00:31:16,800 --> 00:31:18,809
I've given up on it too.

246
00:31:21,679 --> 00:31:23,232
I think...

247
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:26,651
I'll move back to my own house.

248
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:30,740
If you need anything, just let me know.

249
00:31:32,040 --> 00:31:33,350
Thank you.

250
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,720
I'm not letting you go anywhere.

251
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:43,712
Have you forgotten that your house
in Bangkok is being repossessed?

252
00:31:45,600 --> 00:31:48,990
But I can't live like this
with three or four of us, Nat.

253
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:55,077
Don't you believe they're waiting for you?

254
00:31:56,493 --> 00:31:58,430
I know you mean well, Yo,

255
00:31:59,308 --> 00:32:01,339
but I don't want to become a monk.

256
00:32:02,720 --> 00:32:05,120
What if the ghosts come for you?

257
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:07,240
If ghosts are stronger than people,

258
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:08,896
then let them prove it.

259
00:32:16,800 --> 00:32:18,733
Coward!

260
00:32:22,120 --> 00:32:23,960
Weak!

261
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:25,520
Stupid!

262
00:32:25,520 --> 00:32:26,880
Where are you going?

263
00:32:26,880 --> 00:32:31,000
Does he love you,
or is he playing you for a fool?

264
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:35,560
Kadkao... Kadkao...

265
00:32:35,560 --> 00:32:41,080
Kadkao... Kadkao...

266
00:32:41,080 --> 00:32:42,319
Kadkao!

267
00:32:42,319 --> 00:32:43,520
I'm not Kadkao!

268
00:32:43,520 --> 00:32:47,177
Look what he's done to you.

269
00:32:55,870 --> 00:32:57,200
Kadkao!

270
00:32:57,200 --> 00:33:00,691
I'm not Kadkao!

271
00:33:00,691 --> 00:33:03,960
Kadkao...

272
00:33:03,960 --> 00:33:07,974
Kadkao...

273
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:28,133
Yo... Yo, what's wrong?

274
00:33:28,920 --> 00:33:31,658
Yo... Yo!

275
00:33:34,080 --> 00:33:37,803
Come out if you dare! I'm not afraid of you!

276
00:33:39,840 --> 00:33:42,510
Yo... Yo!

277
00:33:57,840 --> 00:34:00,360
Leave those who aren't involved alone.

278
00:34:00,360 --> 00:34:01,400
Piss off!

279
00:34:01,400 --> 00:34:03,361
This is none of your business!

280
00:34:04,400 --> 00:34:07,760
You three are so consumed by hatred,

281
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:11,382
you've forgotten who I am.

282
00:34:12,640 --> 00:34:15,400
I'll speak to Master Lert myself.

283
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,760
Thank you, Uncle.

284
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:20,560
Master Lert, please.
Have mercy on Pan. Sali is pregnant.

285
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:21,760
You dare defy my order?

286
00:34:21,760 --> 00:34:26,083
No, sir. I'd even give
my life for you, Master Lert.

287
00:34:27,600 --> 00:34:31,840
If I hadn't helped you, I wouldn't have died.

288
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:35,640
You three must let go
of your hatred and vengeance.

289
00:34:35,640 --> 00:34:38,360
No! They cursed us so we could never be reborn!

290
00:34:38,360 --> 00:34:39,560
Lert must die!

291
00:34:39,560 --> 00:34:42,600
They must die and take our place!

292
00:34:42,600 --> 00:34:45,840
Then leave Yo alone.
She has nothing to do with this.

293
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:48,925
You think Kadkao isn't involved?

294
00:34:49,640 --> 00:34:54,687
I'll make Kadkao remember
she's no different from us.

295
00:35:15,167 --> 00:35:16,693
Yo...

296
00:35:29,080 --> 00:35:30,880
How are you feeling?

297
00:35:33,120 --> 00:35:35,053
Here. Let me help you.

298
00:35:40,687 --> 00:35:42,813
Have some water.

299
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,516
I'm suffering, Nat.

300
00:35:58,400 --> 00:36:01,409
Why is all this happening to me?

301
00:36:02,600 --> 00:36:05,961
I won't let my life
repeat the same cycle again.

302
00:36:07,560 --> 00:36:08,721
Nat...

303
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:17,151
Please divorce me.

304
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:21,243
No.

305
00:36:22,720 --> 00:36:24,348
Please...

306
00:36:25,640 --> 00:36:27,902
let me go, Nat. Set me free.

307
00:36:30,960 --> 00:36:32,960
I love you, Yo.

308
00:36:34,280 --> 00:36:36,375
And I'm not afraid of any damn ghost.

309
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:42,281
But if you want me to become a monk,

310
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:45,080
I'll do it,

311
00:36:45,080 --> 00:36:46,805
if it'll give you peace of mind.

312
00:36:48,533 --> 00:36:49,996
Really, Nat?

313
00:37:11,640 --> 00:37:13,760
I don't want your merit!

314
00:37:13,760 --> 00:37:14,920
You have to die!

315
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:16,520
You have to break the curse.

316
00:37:16,520 --> 00:37:19,500
Damn you! I don't want your merit!

317
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:23,773
My source told me

318
00:37:23,773 --> 00:37:26,127
things have been strange at this house lately.

319
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:30,280
Sometimes there are loud noises,

320
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:32,930
like someone's dragging
something around upstairs.

321
00:37:33,703 --> 00:37:37,351
Sometimes people hear a woman or a man crying.

322
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:44,009
Think we'll find something
like we did in those other cases?

323
00:37:51,200 --> 00:37:54,609
If they want our help, I think we will.

324
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:08,140
Sorry, Inspector. The power's out for a moment.

325
00:38:08,140 --> 00:38:10,386
The transformer outside the station blew.

326
00:38:17,840 --> 00:38:21,763
Damn, you scared me.
I thought we'd seen a ghost.

327
00:38:33,080 --> 00:38:34,775
Hey!

328
00:38:38,080 --> 00:38:39,280
How can I help you?

329
00:38:39,280 --> 00:38:41,318
Please help Kadkao.

330
00:38:42,720 --> 00:38:46,560
Sure. You can tell
the duty officer what happened.

331
00:38:46,560 --> 00:38:48,293
This way, please.

332
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:53,996
- Hey!
- Where are you going?

333
00:38:53,996 --> 00:38:56,240
Taking someone to file a report.

334
00:38:56,240 --> 00:38:57,297
What?

335
00:38:59,760 --> 00:39:01,240
Where?

336
00:39:01,240 --> 00:39:02,839
Right here.

337
00:39:06,380 --> 00:39:08,200
They were just here.

338
00:39:12,160 --> 00:39:13,864
Where are they?

339
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:26,019
- Good morning, Inspector.
- Morning.

340
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:46,480
Hello, Yo.

341
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:48,127
Can we talk later?

342
00:39:48,127 --> 00:39:51,120
It's not a good time right now.

343
00:39:51,120 --> 00:39:53,360
Okay.

344
00:39:53,360 --> 00:39:55,491
I'll come by this evening. Will you be free?

345
00:39:57,213 --> 00:39:58,616
Sure.

346
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:06,123
Keep it somewhere safe, Yo.

347
00:40:06,933 --> 00:40:09,527
This house is yours now.

348
00:40:09,527 --> 00:40:11,148
So you can finally feel at ease.

349
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:16,674
What about selling it to Pam?

350
00:40:16,674 --> 00:40:19,927
Don't worry about that.
I'll sort it out with her.

351
00:40:21,720 --> 00:40:25,483
I want you to have peace of mind,
so you'll stop thinking about divorce.

352
00:40:32,093 --> 00:40:33,639
I love you, Yo.

353
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:39,005
I love you too.

354
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:42,500
I love you so much.

355
00:40:44,160 --> 00:40:45,864
Don't overthink it anymore.

356
00:40:46,599 --> 00:40:48,311
I'd better get to work now.

357
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:51,809
Okay.

358
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:15,739
[Land Title Deed]

359
00:41:37,048 --> 00:41:39,200
[Memorandum of Registration]

360
00:41:39,200 --> 00:41:41,480
[Gift: Triwit Thanahirankit to
Nat Thanahirankit]

361
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:43,775
[Gift: Nat Thanahirankit to
Yotaka Thanahirankit]

362
00:42:06,320 --> 00:42:10,000
<i>I may have my doubts,</i>

363
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,520
<i>but I don't want to know anymore.</i>

364
00:42:11,520 --> 00:42:13,819
<i>Bitch Bulan killed you!</i>

365
00:42:14,720 --> 00:42:18,441
<i>A fool like you is bound to be betrayed.</i>

366
00:42:18,441 --> 00:42:22,346
<i>You'll be betrayed until you die, Kadkao!</i>

367
00:42:22,346 --> 00:42:28,880
<i>- I'm not Kadkao!
- Kadkao... Kadkao...</i>

368
00:42:28,880 --> 00:42:31,960
I'm not Kadkao!

369
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:33,302
Yo!

370
00:43:01,080 --> 00:43:04,058
<i>I have no idea how it video-called you.</i>

371
00:43:04,058 --> 00:43:05,400
<i>I absolutely refuse to divorce.</i>

372
00:43:05,400 --> 00:43:06,680
<i>But I'm getting a divorce.</i>

373
00:43:06,680 --> 00:43:09,080
<i>You think I'll let you go that easily, Nat?</i>

374
00:43:09,080 --> 00:43:11,000
<i>You'll never get away from me.</i>

375
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:13,840
<i>It's like our ancestors were trying to tell us</i>

376
00:43:13,840 --> 00:43:16,612
<i>that their souls are trapped.</i>

377
00:43:21,120 --> 00:43:23,398
<i>We've waited so long for you.</i>

378
00:43:23,398 --> 00:43:25,360
<i>Go see it for yourself.</i>

379
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:28,680
<i>Send her to the kitchen.
Make her chop wood and carry water.</i>

380
00:43:28,680 --> 00:43:31,279
<i>Don't let her come up here.</i>
